      <title>1700万桶石油通过霍尔木兹海峡，中国进口成本波动风险加剧</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/1700%E4%B8%87%E6%A1%B6%E7%9F%B3%E6%B2%B9%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E9%9C%8D%E5%B0%94%E6%9C%A8%E5%85%B9%E6%B5%B7%E5%B3%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%BF%9B%E5%8F%A3%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E6%B3%A2%E5%8A%A8%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E5%8A%A0%E5%89%A7/</link>
